+
+blob contains glyphs, their positions, and paint attributes specific to text:
+Typeface, Paint_Text_Size, Paint_Text_Scale_X, Paint_Text_Skew_X,
+Paint_Text_Align, Paint_Hinting, Anti-alias, Paint_Fake_Bold,
